## Frontend (Vite)
# If you run the app without Vite proxy, set this to your API base URL.
# If you use `docker compose` from repo root, the frontend is served by Vite on host:5173 and
# requests to /api are proxied to the backend container via Vite proxy (see vite.config.ts),
# so you can leave this unset.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3001/api

## Backend
JWT_SECRET=change-me-in-prod

# When running with `docker compose` from repo root:
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://productier:productier@postgres:5432/productier

